            <ArticleTitle>[Roentgen imaging in acute abdominal pain is dispensable].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1054-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Plain abdominal X-ray films are overused in patients with acute abdominal pain. Focusing on medical history and physical examination helps to reduce the number of plain films used and saves costs.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
